  title: "Two Newspaper Clippings"
  body: "BOY, 7, KILLED OUTSIDE HOME\nA seven-year-old boy was struck on the street in front of his house while running home from a friend's. He did not survive.\n\n\u2014\n\nNOTED PAINTER VANISHES FROM HOME STUDIO LATE AT NIGHT\nPolice: no sign of foul play; may have left of his own accord."
